      "text": "Far from Earth, Ryland Grace wakes on a spacecraft without knowing what brought him there. He gradually discovers that he is the only surviving member of a mission whose outcome could determine humanity’s survival. Recovering his memories is only part of the problem: he must also understand an unfamiliar scientific threat. The novel follows his attempts to investigate it with the limited resources available to him.",
